{"title":"Riemann sum","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>A <b>Riemann sum</b> is a finite approximation to the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Integral\" title=\"Integral\">Riemann Integral</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Definition\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Definition</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Related_Terms\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Related Terms</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#The_Upper_sum\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">The Upper sum</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#The_Lower_sum\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">The Lower sum</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Definition\">Definition</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Riemann_sum&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Definition\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/c/67c320754a36aaec178e61f04bfcbac41c0bf675.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f:[a,b]\\rightarrow\\mathbb{R}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"102\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/4/1e4a621081b8c5c6b18dfd7163da5adfe7dcb1a2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathcal{\\dot{P}}=\\{([x_{i-1},x_i],t_i)\\}_{i=1}^n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"178\" height=\"21\" /> be a <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Partition_of_an_interval\" title=\"Partition of an interval\">tagged partition</a> on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/c/8ecbd1ba3da8f2adef66a63f2ab32c47e63fa734.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[a,b]$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"37\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>The <b>Riemann sum</b> of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/2/bb2c93730dbb48558bb3c4738c956c4e8f816437.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"13\" height=\"18\" /> with respect to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/e/d7e0599a6618d30957619f214699749da9938ad7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathcal{\\dot{P}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"18\" /> on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/c/8ecbd1ba3da8f2adef66a63f2ab32c47e63fa734.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[a,b]$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"37\" height=\"20\" /> is defined as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/0/5c0b996dd4cf33c28cb01e01fd128c6485f8181d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S(f,\\mathcal{\\dot{P}})=\\sum_{i=1}^n f(t_i)(x_i-x_{i-1})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -20px\" width=\"232\" height=\"48\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Related_Terms\">Related Terms</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Riemann_sum&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Related Terms\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"The_Upper_sum\">The Upper sum</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Riemann_sum&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: The Upper sum\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/c/67c320754a36aaec178e61f04bfcbac41c0bf675.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f:[a,b]\\rightarrow\\mathbb{R}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"102\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/9/8b9f0a714dd3dcc08115d8b1358997a7a8528354.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathcal{P}=\\{[x_{i-1},x_i]\\}_{i=1}^n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"143\" height=\"19\" /> be a <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Partition_of_an_interval\" title=\"Partition of an interval\">partition</a> on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/c/8ecbd1ba3da8f2adef66a63f2ab32c47e63fa734.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[a,b]$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"37\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/b/2ab5a8f2754e53b041dd11ce7d0804f6f2c82909.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M_i=\\sup \\{f(x):x\\in [x_{i-1},x_i]\\}\\forall i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"261\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>The <b>Upper sum</b> of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/2/bb2c93730dbb48558bb3c4738c956c4e8f816437.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"13\" height=\"18\" /> with respect to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/f/74f4008768812f46db4b252c9e69cf98c5faaa4b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathcal{P}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/c/8ecbd1ba3da8f2adef66a63f2ab32c47e63fa734.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[a,b]$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"37\" height=\"20\" /> is defined as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/9/009e01e6083836846cb4b8ff7b37ad03a36a43ce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$U(f,\\mathcal{P})=\\sum_{i=1}^n M_i (x_i-x_{i-1})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -20px\" width=\"220\" height=\"48\" />\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"The_Lower_sum\">The Lower sum</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Riemann_sum&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: The Lower sum\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/c/67c320754a36aaec178e61f04bfcbac41c0bf675.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f:[a,b]\\rightarrow\\mathbb{R}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"102\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/9/8b9f0a714dd3dcc08115d8b1358997a7a8528354.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathcal{P}=\\{[x_{i-1},x_i]\\}_{i=1}^n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"143\" height=\"19\" /> be a <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Partition_of_an_interval\" title=\"Partition of an interval\">partition</a> on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/c/8ecbd1ba3da8f2adef66a63f2ab32c47e63fa734.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[a,b]$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"37\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/b/a5b6c98e5d3ba94be39aa33425a15155ee1c3b83.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m_i=\\inf \\{f(x):x\\in [x_{i-1},x_i]\\}\\forall i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"254\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>The <b>Lower sum</b> of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/2/bb2c93730dbb48558bb3c4738c956c4e8f816437.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"13\" height=\"18\" /> with respect to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/f/74f4008768812f46db4b252c9e69cf98c5faaa4b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathcal{P}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/c/8ecbd1ba3da8f2adef66a63f2ab32c47e63fa734.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[a,b]$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"37\" height=\"20\" /> is defined as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/f/4ef7d5ba2b5c5afc541a24e9ee4c40e7dd2761a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$L(f,\\mathcal{P})=\\sum_{i=1}^n m_i (x_i-x_{i-1})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -20px\" width=\"216\" height=\"48\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Riemann_sum&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Integral\" title=\"Integral\">Integral</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Partition_of_an_interval\" title=\"Partition of an interval\">Partition of an interval</a></li></ul>\n<p><br />\n<i>This article is a stub.  Help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=Riemann_sum&amp;action=edit\">expanding it</a></span>.</i>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018105117\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.018 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.033 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 140/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 274/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4442/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    5.316      1 Template:Stub\n100.00%    5.316      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:6437:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018105117 and revision id 25898. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}